# HL VMAX PC-case LCD (33c3:f101)
# Must sort before 73-seat-late.rules or the uaccess tag is ignored.
# - give the logged-in user access to the serial port (no dialout group needed)
# - stop ModemManager from probing it as a modem
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="33c3", ATTRS{idProduct}=="f101", TAG+="uaccess", ENV{ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE}="1", SYMLINK+="vmax-lcd"
